{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-03-02 13:19:00', 'title': 'HARRIS WILLIAMS ADVISES WEST STAR AVIATION ON ITS SALE TO THE STERLING GROUP', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HARRIS WILLIAMS, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT BANK SPECIALIZING IN M&A ADVISORY SERVICES, ANNOUNCES IT ADVISED WEST STAR AVIATION (WEST STAR), A PORTFOLIO COMPANY OF NORWEST EQUITY PARTNERS (NEP), ON ITS SALE TO THE STERLING GROUP (STERLING). WEST STAR IS A LEADING INDEPENDENT PROVIDER OF MAINTENANCE, REPAIRS AND OPERATIONS (MRO) SERVICES TO THE BUSINESS AVIATION INDUSTRY. THE TRANSACTION WAS LED BY CHRIS ROGERS, DOUG KINARD, DAVID JONES, EVAN CLARK AND KEVIN WINTON O'}